# 10. EMAIL / WHATSAPP INTERACTION WITH TELEGRAM

Do not change the existing approval notification behavior.

Current approval/rejection flow remains:

```text
HRD/Admin Approve
      ↓
Approved
      ↓
Email notification → Employee
      ↓
WhatsApp CTA → Employee
```

or:

```text
HRD/Admin Reject
      ↓
Rejected
      ↓
Email notification → Employee
      ↓
WhatsApp CTA → Employee
```

New Telegram notification is ONLY:

```text
Employee submits new request
      ↓
Telegram notification → HRD/Admin
```

Do not send Telegram notifications on approval/rejection unless a future requirement explicitly asks for that.

